flowchart TD
    subgraph CS["Client-Side Discovery"]
        C1[Client] -->|1. Query registry| R1[(Service registry)]
        R1 -->|2. Healthy instances| C1
        C1 -->|3. Direct call to a chosen instance| S1[Service instance]
    end

    subgraph SS["Server-Side Discovery"]
        C2[Client] -->|1. Call load balancer| LB[Load balancer]
        LB -->|2. Query registry| R2[(Service registry)]
        R2 -->|3. Healthy instances| LB
        LB -->|4. Route to an instance| S2[Service instance]
    end

    S1 -.->|Heartbeats and health status| R1
    S2 -.->|Heartbeats and health status| R2
